---
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
import { SOCIALS, url } from '../consts';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="Who writes this blog and why.">
	<div class="container">
		<PageHead eyebrow="About" title="Who writes this" seed="about-netf" inverse>
			<p>I'm netf. I build platforms so that shipping software is the least interesting part of anyone's day.</p>
		</PageHead>
		<div class="prose">
			<p>
				I work on DevOps and platform engineering: the internal platforms, pipelines and guardrails that
				let product teams ship safely and quickly. This blog is where I write down what I learn along the
				way, mostly about:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Kubernetes, GitOps and cluster operations</li>
				<li>Infrastructure as code with Terraform and friends</li>
				<li>CI/CD, release engineering and developer experience</li>
				<li>Observability, SLOs and incident response</li>
				<li>Treating the platform as a product</li>
			</ul>
			<h2>How I write</h2>
			<p>
				If I didn't observe it, it isn't in the post, and if I couldn't test something, I say so. Lab posts
				link to the scripts and raw output, so you can rerun them and tell me where I'm wrong.
			</p>
			<p>
				You can find me on <a href={SOCIALS.github}>GitHub</a>, or follow new posts with the
				<a href={url('/rss.xml')}>RSS feed</a>. Opinions are my own and probably eventually consistent.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Base>
